      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T00:42:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One more question: I can see the similar packet loss in the NFC, but I could reproduce the issue even when FD is closed after reading all necessary bits, and write happens after FD is fully recreated.\n\nAfter I turned off NFC, I confirmed that all bytes from casimir (a.k.a. NFC rootcanal) are fully read. And turned on NFC after that. So I think that there had been no cancelled read between turning off/on. What do you think? I\u0027m unsure whether this issue is happened because of the cancelled file read or not.",
      "revId": "4fec12a6f0581d346c3748a9f1e478f1f6e9da5d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
